{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07366","headline":"自紫阳观至华阳洞宿侯尊师草堂简同游李延年 · 刘长卿","name":"自紫阳观至华阳洞宿侯尊师草堂简同游李延年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石门媚烟景，句曲盘江甸。\n南向佳气浓，数峰遥隐见。\n渐临华阳口，云路入葱蒨。\n七曜悬洞宫，五云抱仙殿。\n银函竟谁发，金液徒堪荐。\n千载空桃花，秦人深不见。\n东溪喜相遇，贞白如会面。\n青鸟来去闲，红霞朝夕变。\n一从换仙骨，万里乘飞电。\n萝月延步虚，松花醉闲宴。\n幽人即长往，茂宰应交战。\n明发归琴堂，知君嬾爲县。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}